### Page 3: Recipe Results Page
**Route:** `/results?ingredients=1123,11260,1053`
**Purpose:** Display recipes ranked by match from mock database with persistent search
**User Access:** Signed-in users only

**Layout:**
```
+--------------------------------------------------+
| [Sidebar] [← Back to Search]                     |
|  Search    Searching with:                       |
|  Pantry    +--------------------------------+    |
|  Favorites| [eggs] [x]  [mushrooms] [x]    |    |
|  Account   | Type to add/remove...          |    |
|            +--------------------------------+    |
|                [Update Results]                  |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|            24 recipes found                      |
|  +----------------+  +----------------+           |
|  | [Recipe Image] |  | [Recipe Image] |          |
|  | Recipe Name    |  | Recipe Name    |          |
|  | 5/6 match 83%  |  | 4/6 match 67%  |          |
|  | Need: butter   |  | Need: garlic   |          |
|  | 30min | 4 serv |  | 45min | 2 serv |          |
|  | [♡ Save]       |  | [♡ Save]       |          |
|  +----------------+  +----------------+           |
|                 [Show More]                      |
+--------------------------------------------------+
```

**Primary Data:**
- Active search ingredients: Displayed as editable chips (same as search page)
- Recipe count: "X recipes found"
- Recipe cards with: image, name, match badge, missing ingredients, stats, save button

**User Actions:**
- **Add ingredient via autocomplete** → Chip appears, auto-triggers new search
- **Remove ingredient (click X)** → Chip removed, auto-triggers new search  
- **Click "Update Results"** → Manual trigger to re-search (optional, if auto-search disabled)
- Click recipe card → Navigate to `/recipe/:id`
- Click heart → Save to favorites
- Click "Show More" → Load 9 more recipes
- Click "Back to Search" → Return to `/search` (preserves current ingredient selection)

**Interaction Behavior:**
- **Auto-search on change:** When user adds/removes ingredient, results refresh automatically after 500ms debounce
- **Loading state:** Show skeleton cards while searching, keep ingredient bar interactive
- **URL sync:** Update query params (`?ingredients=1123,11260`) on each search
- **Preserve scroll:** When auto-searching, maintain scroll position if possible, or scroll to top smoothly
- **Empty chips:** If all ingredients removed, show message: "Add at least one ingredient to search"

**Design Notes:**
- Ingredient search bar uses same styling as main search page (blue-tinted chips for pantry items, gray for temporary)
- Search bar stays "sticky" at top when scrolling (desktop) or below fixed header (mobile)
- Results count updates dynamically: "24 recipes found" → "18 recipes found"
- Smooth transitions when results update (fade out/in, not jarring replacement)

