## 7. Interaction Patterns and Micro-interactions

**Modal vs. New Page:**
- No modals in MVP (focused page flows)
- All auth flows use dedicated pages

**Notifications/Toasts:**
- Position: Bottom-right (desktop), bottom-center (mobile)
- Duration: 3 seconds auto-dismiss
- Types: Success (green), Error (red), Info with undo (blue)
- Stack limit: Maximum 2 toasts

**Loading Indicators:**
- Skeleton screens: Recipe cards, ingredient chips
- Inline spinners: Save buttons, form submissions
- Timeout: 10 seconds with error + retry

**Undo Actions:**
- Remove from pantry/favorites: Toast with "Undo" button (3-second window)

## 8. Edge Cases and Error Handling

**Empty State Messaging:**
- Search results: "No recipes match these ingredients. Try removing one or adding alternatives."
- Pantry: "Your pantry is empty. Add ingredients: eggs, milk, butter..."
- Favorites (none): "You haven't saved any recipes yet. Search and click the heart!"
- Favorites (filter): "No favorites in this category. Try adding more to your pantry."
- All ingredients removed on results page: "Add at least one ingredient to search"

**Form Validation:**
- Real-time validation on field blur
- Inline errors below fields
- Submit disabled until valid
- Messages: "Enter a valid email", "Password must be 8+ characters", "Passwords don't match"

**Error Messages:**
- Search failures: "Couldn't load recipes. Please try again." with retry
- Auth failures: "Invalid email or password"
- Database failures: Revert UI, toast: "Couldn't save. Try again."
- Network failures: "Check your internet connection."

**Protected Routes:**
- Unauthenticated accessing protected routes → Redirect to `/auth/signin`
- Authenticated accessing landing/auth → Redirect to `/search`

## 9. Performance and UX Considerations

**Pagination:** "Show More" button (loads 9 recipes per click)

**Lazy Loading:**
- Recipe images: IntersectionObserver
- Autocomplete: 300ms debounce
- Recipe details: On-demand

**Optimistic Updates:**
- Add to favorites/pantry: Update UI immediately, revert on failure
- Show undo toast for reversible actions

**Caching:**
- Ingredient list: LocalStorage (refresh daily)
- Recipe details: SessionStorage (avoid refetch on back)
- Autocomplete: Memory cache for session
- No caching for search results

**URL State Management:**
- When ingredients change on `/results`, update URL params without full page reload
- Use `router.replace()` instead of `router.push()` to avoid cluttering browser history
- Parse URL params on page load to restore search state

